{
  "theme": "tumblr",
  "era": "2019 Tumblr: navy #001935/#36465d site in every mode (Tumblr had no light theme until 2021 palettes), white rounded post cards, 't' logo with a translucent search field, header icons, Explore tabs (For You / Trending / Staff Picks / More), right column of recommended blogs and tags. The purple 'Join over 100 million people…' sign-up bar, Communities, Blaze, TumblrMart and Tumblr Live are later.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "url": "https://chriskyfung.github.io/blog/tumblr-tricks/featured-tips-tricks-and-tools-for-tumblr-bloggers",
      "date": "2019",
      "shows": "desktop dashboard: navy page, t logo + Search Tumblr, header icons, post-type bar, Recommended Blogs and Radar"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
